# Legacy cookbook corpus: cookbook/file/012_skip_dot

## Case: legacy-cookbook-file-012-skip-dot
id: "legacy.cookbook.file.012_skip_dot"
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "skip_dot.at"
```auto
use.rs std::fs

fn main() ! {
    let entries = fs.read_dir(".").?
    var non_dot = 0
    for entry in entries {
        let entry = entry.?
        let name = entry.file_name()
        let name_str = name.to_str().unwrap()
        if !name_str.starts_with(".") {
            non_dot += 1
        }
    }
    assert(non_dot > 0)
}
```

